      "kind": "concept",
      "body": "When the points aren't at the origin, **subtract the coordinates** to get the legs. From (1, 2) to (4, 6): Δx = 4 − 1 = 3 and Δy = 6 − 2 = 4, so d = √(9 + 16) = 5. The differences are the triangle's legs.",
